  "boundary_note": "A/C condenser replacement requires proper refrigerant recovery before opening the circuit and evacuation, leak testing, oil accounting, and R-134a recharge after installation. The 2009 Civic Hybrid electric compressor requires SANDEN SE-10Y POE oil; this repair is intentionally professional-required and does not publish DIY procedural actions."
